    "background_story": "Malakai was a former army medic who found a new sense of purpose after being honorably discharged. He became a helicopter pilot, using his skills to rescue people from natural disasters and remote areas. Nicknamed 'Chopper' by his colleagues, Malakai was known for his exceptional flying skills and calm demeanor under pressure. He flew for a humanitarian organization, transporting aid and medical supplies to areas inaccessible by land. Malakai's most notable mission was during a devastating hurricane, where he flew through treacherous conditions to rescue a family trapped in their flooded home. His bravery and expertise earned him numerous accolades, but Malakai remained humble, always ready to take to the skies and help those in need.",
